# PMOVES-ToKenism-Multi Submodules Configuration
#
# IMPORTANT: This directory previously contained invalid absolute path entries.
# Those were RUNTIME INTEGRATIONS (via NATS/gRPC/HTTP networking), not git submodules.
#
# Services like PMOVES-DoX and PMOVES-Wealth integrate via "holographic" networking:
# - Docked mode: Connect to parent PMOVES.AI infrastructure
# - Standalone mode: Use local resources
# - Hybrid mode: Mix local and parent resources
#
# Git submodules = Code ownership
# Networking integrations = Runtime collaboration
#
# No nested git submodules are needed for this service.
